# SimpleSecScan - Cloudflare Edition

A web-based cybersecurity tool that allows users to upload code files and receive AI-powered vulnerability analysis.

This project leverages a serverless architecture using Cloudflare services:
-   **Frontend:** Cloudflare Pages (HTML/CSS/JS)
-   **Backend:** Cloudflare Workers
-   **Database:** Cloudflare D1
-   **Storage:** Cloudflare R2
-   **AI:** Google Gemini API
